  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">At Stinger Pickleball, we believe in empowering players to build stronger, more connected communities through the love of the game. The Stinger Ambassador Program is for players who are passionate about pickleball and want to make a difference by sharing their enthusiasm and knowledge.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We believe that great performance starts with quality materials. That&rsquo;s why our paddles are built using the same premium materials and advanced construction methods as the industry&rsquo;s top brands. But we don&rsquo;t stop there&mdash;we elevate the game with a unique edge that truly sets us apart.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Our pickleball paddles deliver an unmatched playing experience through the perfect balance of high twist weight and low overall paddle weight. This means you get the agility and maneuverability you need for quick responses at the net, paired with the stability and power that make every shot count.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">For the best playing experience, you want an ultralight paddle with a high twist weight. That&rsquo;s the ideal combination&mdash;and Stinger Paddles deliver it. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Join the Stinger family and receive</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><strong>Early Access to Products</strong>: Be the first to test and showcase Stinger&rsquo;s latest paddles and gear.</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><strong>Welcome Package</strong>: Receive demo gear and branded materials to help you share the Stinger difference.</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\"><strong>Ongoing Rewards</strong>: Enjoy ambassador-exclusive perks and prizes throughout the year to celebrate your contributions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>10% Sales Commision</strong>: Promote and earn on all sales of Stinger paddles and gear.</li>\r\n</ul>",
